abstract: "Camera blackout exploration across four public LIBERO-Spatial policies; further visual perturbations on three dual-view policies; a focused wrist-treatment study on LeRobot pi0/pi0.5; and separate checkpoint/pipeline, state-update and fixed-action controls. Five public-checkpoint reference comparisons provide the engineering foundation."
